vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,9)\">Exod 30:9</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>לִנְסֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,1)\">Isa 30:1</ref> <highlight>Participle Pass.</highlight> feminine <bdbheb>נְסוּכָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 25:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,7)\">Isa 25:7</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>pour out</highlight>, with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> (the spirit of deep sleep) <ref ref=\"Isa 29:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,10)\">Isa 29:10</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>pour out libations</highlight>, with accusative <bdbheb>נֶסֶךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,9)\">Exod 30:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>מַסֵּכָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,1)\">Isa 30:1</ref> <bdbheb>יַיִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:4\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,4)\">Hos 9:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>cast metal images</highlight>, with accusative <bdbheb>פֶּסֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 40:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,19)\">Isa 40:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,10)\">Isa 44:10</ref>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p><b>Piel</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יְנַסֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,18)\">1Chr 11:18</ref> <highlight>pour out as libation</highlight>, with accusative <bdbheb>מַיִם</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>ליהוה</bdbheb> (= <ref ref